title: The Death of Paul Levi
view-if: year == 1930 and month >= 2
frequency: 1000
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: levi_dead = 1; workers_sapd *= 0.75 if sapd_formed == 1 and sapd_consolidated != 1; workers_sapd *= 0.9 if sapd_consolidated == 1; succession_levi = 1 if levi_advisor == 1 or chancellor == "Levi" or spd_coleader_1 == "Levi" or spd_coleader_2 == "Levi" or spd_coleader_3 == "Levi"  
tags: event

= The Death of Paul Levi

Paul Levi, a leader of the left wing of our party, has died in an unfortunate accident. He will be missed.

- @levi_chancellor_succession: We must decide his successor as Chancellor.
- @levi_vice_chancellor_succession: We must decide his successor as Vice-Chancellor.
- @levi_coleader_1_succession: We must decide his successor as Co-leader.
- @levi_coleader_2_succession: We must decide his successor as Co-leader.
- @levi_coleader_3_succession: We must decide his successor as Co-leader.
- @succession_concluded: We have dealt with all matters of succession.

@levi_chancellor_succession
view-if: chancellor == "Levi"
go-to: election_1928.chancellor_menu

Who should succeed Levi as Chancellor?

@levi_vice_chancellor_succession
view-if: vice_chancellor == "Levi"
go-to: election_1928.vice_chancellor_menu

Who should succeed Levi as Vice-Chancellor?

@levi_coleader_1_succession
view-if: spd_coleader_1 == "Levi"
on-arrival: levi_advisor = 0; n_advisors -= 1
go-to: shuffle_leadership.add_advisors

Who should succeed Levi as Co-leader?

@levi_coleader_2_succession
view-if: spd_coleader_2 == "Levi" 
on-arrival: levi_advisor = 0; n_advisors -= 1
go-to: shuffle_leadership.add_advisors

Who should succeed Levi as Co-leader?

@levi_coleader_3_succession
view-if: spd_coleader_3 == "Levi" 
on-arrival: levi_advisor = 0; n_advisors -= 1
go-to: shuffle_leadership.add_advisors

Who should succeed Levi as Co-leader?

@succession_concluded
view-if: levi_advisor == 0 and chancellor != "Levi" and spd_coleader_1 != "Levi" and spd_coleader_2 != "Levi" and spd_coleader_3 != "Levi"
on-arrival: succession_levi = 0
